// 公开仓导出的擦除规则与按字节的模式匹配（scripts/export.tx 用；元字符与各行的含义见清单 release/export.txt §六，
// ）。擦除的字样都在不导出的清单里，本文件只有通用的匹配机制。
import { byteSub, join, kindOf, safeRel, startsWith } from "./build_lib";

export struct Pair {
    a: Bytes,
    b: Bytes,
}

export struct Allow {
    path: string,
    pat: Bytes,
}

// 擦除与泄漏检查的规则（清单 §六 各行）及按字节匹配用的字符类。
export struct Rules {
    scrub: List<Bytes>,
    leak: List<Bytes>,
    excepts: List<Bytes>,
    particles: List<Bytes>,
    leads: List<Bytes>,
    missing: List<Bytes>,
    replaces: List<Ref<Pair>>,
    strips: List<Ref<Pair>>,
    keep: List<string>,
    allows: List<Ref<Allow>>,
    scrubTab: Bytes,
    leakTab: Bytes,
    cnums: List<Bytes>,
    circled: List<Bytes>,
    tailMb: List<Bytes>,
    trims: List<Bytes>,
    seps: List<Bytes>,
    colons: List<Bytes>,
    opens: List<Bytes>,
    closes: List<Bytes>,
    endp: List<Bytes>,
    tilde: Bytes,
    section: Bytes,
    di: Bytes,
    jieTail: Bytes,
}

// 一次匹配的结果：终点与命中的模式（missing 前缀或 scrub／leak 模式）。
export struct Hit {
    end: int,
    pat: Bytes,
}

export function at(t: Bytes, i: int): int {
    if (i < 0 || i >= bytesLen(t)) {
        return -1;
    }
    return bytesGet(t, i) ?? -1;
}

export function isDigit(c: int): bool {
    return c >= 48 && c <= 57;
}

export function isAlnum(c: int): bool {
    return isDigit(c) || (c >= 97 && c <= 122) || (c >= 65 && c <= 90);
}

// t 的 i 处是否恰为 p。
export function hasAt(t: Bytes, i: int, p: Bytes): bool {
    const n = bytesLen(p);
    if (i < 0 || i + n > bytesLen(t)) {
        return false;
    }
    let k = 0;
    while (k < n) {
        if ((bytesGet(t, i + k) ?? -1) != (bytesGet(p, k) ?? -2)) {
            return false;
        }
        k = k + 1;
    }
    return true;
}

// i 处以表中某项开头则得其长度，否则 0（表按先长后短排列）。
export function anyAt(t: Bytes, i: int, lst: List<Bytes>): int {
    for (p in lst) {
        if (hasAt(t, i, p)) {
            return bytesLen(p);
        }
    }
    return 0;
}

// i 之前紧挨着表中某项则得其长度，否则 0。
export function anyBefore(t: Bytes, i: int, lst: List<Bytes>): int {
    for (p in lst) {
        const n = bytesLen(p);
        if (i >= n && hasAt(t, i - n, p)) {
            return n;
        }
    }
    return 0;
}

// 同 anyBefore，但那一项须整个落在 lo 之后（不越过注释起点去看注释符或代码）。
export function anyBeforeLo(t: Bytes, i: int, lst: List<Bytes>, lo: int): int {
    for (p in lst) {
        const n = bytesLen(p);
        if (i - n >= lo && hasAt(t, i - n, p)) {
            return n;
        }
    }
    return 0;
}

export function findFrom(t: Bytes, p: Bytes, from: int): int {
    const n = bytesLen(t) - bytesLen(p);
    let i = from;
    while (i <= n) {
        if (hasAt(t, i, p)) {
            return i;
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return -1;
}

export function slice(t: Bytes, a: int, b: int): Bytes {
    return bytesSlice(t, a, b - a);
}

// 去掉 [a, b)。
export function cut(t: Bytes, a: int, b: int): Bytes {
    const r = bytesSlice(t, 0, a);
    bytesAppend(r, bytesSlice(t, b, bytesLen(t) - b));
    return r;
}

export function cat(a: Bytes, b: Bytes): Bytes {
    const r = bytesSlice(a, 0, bytesLen(a));
    bytesAppend(r, b);
    return r;
}

export function bytesOfList(words: string): List<Bytes> {
    const out: List<Bytes> = listNew();
    for (w in strSplit(words, " ")) {
        if (len(w) > 0) {
            listPush(out, bytesFromStr(w));
        }
    }
    return out;
}

export function plusB(a: List<Bytes>, b: List<Bytes>): List<Bytes> {
    const out: List<Bytes> = listNew();
    for (x in a) {
        listPush(out, x);
    }
    for (x in b) {
        listPush(out, x);
    }
    return out;
}

export function endsWith(s: string, suffix: string): bool {
    return len(s) >= len(suffix) && byteSub(s, len(s) - len(suffix), len(suffix)) == suffix;
}

export function newRules(): Ref<Rules> {
    const r = new Rules { scrub: listNew(), leak: listNew(), excepts: listNew(), particles: listNew(), leads: listNew(), missing: listNew(),
        replaces: listNew(), strips: listNew(), keep: listNew(), allows: listNew(), scrubTab: bytesNew(256),
        leakTab: bytesNew(256), cnums: bytesOfList("〇 一 二 三 四 五 六 七 八 九 十"),
        circled: bytesOfList("① ② ③ ④ ⑤ ⑥ ⑦ ⑧ ⑨ ⑩ ⑪ ⑫ ⑬ ⑭ ⑮ ⑯ ⑰ ⑱ ⑲ ⑳"), tailMb: listNew(), trims: bytesOfList(". - / _ –"),
        seps: bytesOfList("—— — ； ， 、 ／ ＋ ; , / +"), colons: bytesOfList("： :"), opens: bytesOfList("（ ("),
        closes: bytesOfList("） )"), endp: bytesOfList("。 ！ ？ ! ?"), tilde: bytesFromStr("~"), section: bytesFromStr("§"),
        di: bytesFromStr("第"), jieTail: bytesFromStr("第%节") };
    r.tailMb = plusB(plusB(bytesOfList("′ § –"), r.circled), r.cnums);
    return r;
}

// 行首的词之后、去掉两端空格的其余部分（模式里可以有空格）。
export function restOf(line: string, verb: string): string {
    const b = bytesFromStr(line);
    let i = len(verb);
    while (i < bytesLen(b) && at(b, i) == 32) {
        i = i + 1;
    }
    let j = bytesLen(b);
    while (j > i && at(b, j - 1) == 32) {
        j = j - 1;
    }
    return bytesToStr(slice(b, i, j)) catch "";
}

// “甲 => 乙”拆成两半；乙可为空（“甲 =>”）。
export function splitArrow(rest: string): Ref<Pair> | Error {
    const b = bytesFromStr(rest);
    const k = findFrom(b, bytesFromStr(" => "), 0);
    if (k >= 0) {
        return new Pair { a: slice(b, 0, k), b: slice(b, k + 4, bytesLen(b)) };
    }
    if (endsWith(rest, " =>")) {
        return new Pair { a: slice(b, 0, bytesLen(b) - 3), b: bytesNew(0) };
    }
    return err("缺少“ => ”：" + rest);
}

export function scrubLine(verb: string, rest: string, sr: Ref<Rules>): bool | Error {
    if (len(rest) == 0) {
        return err(verb + " 缺少内容");
    }
    const b = bytesFromStr(rest);
    if (verb == "scrub") {
        listPush(sr.scrub, b);
    } else if (verb == "leak") {
        listPush(sr.leak, b);
    } else if (verb == "except") {
        listPush(sr.excepts, b);
    } else if (verb == "particle") {
        listPush(sr.particles, b);
    } else if (verb == "lead") {
        listPush(sr.leads, b);
    } else if (verb == "missing") {
        listPush(sr.missing, b);
    } else if (verb == "keep") {
        listPush(sr.keep, rest);
    } else if (verb == "replace" || verb == "strip") {
        const p = splitArrow(rest) catch (e) {
            return e;
        };
        if (bytesLen(p.a) == 0) {
            return err(verb + " 的前一半为空");
        }
        if (verb == "replace") {
            listPush(sr.replaces, p);
        } else {
            listPush(sr.strips, p);
        }
    } else if (verb == "allow") {
        const k = findFrom(b, bytesFromStr(" "), 0);
        if (k <= 0) {
            return err("allow 须为“路径 模式”：" + rest);
        }
        listPush(sr.allows, new Allow { path: bytesToStr(slice(b, 0, k)) catch "", pat: slice(b, k + 1, bytesLen(b)) });
    } else {
        return err("不认识的规则：" + verb);
    }
    return true;
}

export function asciiHead(c: int): bool {
    return isAlnum(c) || c == 35 || c == 36 || c == 64 || c == 46;
}

export function wordByte(c: int): bool {
    return isAlnum(c) || c == 95 || c == 46 || c == 47 || c == 126 || c == 45;
}

// 模式开头前一个字节若是字母数字或 _ . ~ -，不算词界（路径分隔符 / 算：“v0.15/编号”里的编号照样认）。
export function headBlock(c: int): bool {
    return isAlnum(c) || c == 95 || c == 46 || c == 126 || c == 45;
}

export function tailLen(r: Ref<Rules>, t: Bytes, i: int): int {
    const c = at(t, i);
    if (c < 0) {
        return 0;
    }
    if (c < 128) {
        if (isAlnum(c) || c == 45 || c == 46 || c == 47 || c == 95) {
            return 1;
        }
        return 0;
    }
    return anyAt(t, i, r.tailMb);
}

// 模式在 t 的 i 处匹配则得终点，否则 -1。
export function matchAt(r: Ref<Rules>, pat: Bytes, t: Bytes, i: int): int {
    const m = bytesLen(pat);
    if (m == 0) {
        return -1;
    }
    if (asciiHead(at(pat, 0)) && i > 0 && headBlock(at(t, i - 1))) {
        return -1;
    }
    const n = bytesLen(t);
    let j = i;
    let k = 0;
    while (k < m) {
        const c = at(pat, k);
        if (c == 35) {
            const s = j;
            while (isDigit(at(t, j))) {
                j = j + 1;
            }
            if (j == s) {
                return -1;
            }
        } else if (c == 37) {
            const s = j;
            while (true) {
                const w = anyAt(t, j, r.cnums);
                if (w == 0) {
                    break;
                }
                j = j + w;
            }
            if (j == s) {
                return -1;
            }
        } else if (c == 64) {
            const d = at(t, j);
            if (d >= 97 && d <= 122) {
                j = j + 1;
            } else {
                return -1;
            }
        } else if (c == 36) {
            const d = at(t, j);
            if (d >= 65 && d <= 90) {
                j = j + 1;
            } else {
                return -1;
            }
        } else if (c == 126 || c == 94) {
            const s = j;
            while (true) {
                const w = tailLen(r, t, j);
                if (w == 0) {
                    break;
                }
                j = j + w;
            }
            while (j > s) {
                const w = anyBefore(t, j, r.trims);
                if (w == 0) {
                    break;
                }
                j = j - w;
            }
            if (c == 94 && j == s) {
                return -1;
            }
        } else if (c == 95) {
            if (at(t, j) == 32) {
                j = j + 1;
            }
        } else {
            if (at(t, j) == c) {
                j = j + 1;
            } else {
                return -1;
            }
        }
        k = k + 1;
    }
    const last = at(pat, m - 1);
    if ((isAlnum(last) || last == 35 || last == 36 || last == 64) && j < n && (isAlnum(at(t, j)) || at(t, j) == 95)) {
        return -1;
    }
    if (last == 35 && at(t, j) == 46 && isDigit(at(t, j + 1))) {
        return -1;
    }
    return j;
}

export function excepted(r: Ref<Rules>, t: Bytes, i: int): bool {
    for (ex in r.excepts) {
        if (hasAt(t, i, ex) && !isDigit(at(t, i + bytesLen(ex)))) {
            return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
}

export function firstOk(pat: Bytes, c: int): bool {
    const p = at(pat, 0);
    if (p == 35) {
        return isDigit(c);
    }
    if (p == 64) {
        return c >= 97 && c <= 122;
    }
    if (p == 36) {
        return c >= 65 && c <= 90;
    }
    if (p == 37) {
        return c >= 128;
    }
    if (p == 126 || p == 94 || p == 95) {
        return true;
    }
    return c == p;
}

// 各模式（与 missing 前缀）可能的首字节表：不在表里的位置不必逐个试。
export function firstTable(r: Ref<Rules>, pats: List<Bytes>): Bytes {
    const tab = bytesNew(256);
    for (pat in pats) {
        let c = 0;
        while (c < 256) {
            if (firstOk(pat, c)) {
                bytesSet(tab, c, 1);
            }
            c = c + 1;
        }
    }
    for (pre in r.missing) {
        bytesSet(tab, at(pre, 0), 1);
    }
    return tab;
}

// 按清单顺序试各模式：中则得终点并记下模式，否则 -1。
export function matchPats(r: Ref<Rules>, pats: List<Bytes>, t: Bytes, i: int, hit: Ref<Hit>): int {
    const c = at(t, i);
    for (pat in pats) {
        if (!firstOk(pat, c)) {
            continue;
        }
        const e = matchAt(r, pat, t, i);
        if (e > i && !excepted(r, t, i)) {
            hit.pat = pat;
            hit.end = e;
            return e;
        }
    }
    return -1;
}

export function isPathByte(c: int): bool {
    return isAlnum(c) || c == 46 || c == 95 || c == 47 || c == 45;
}

// 仓内路径单元：missing 前缀开头、在导出树里不存在。得单元起点（终点记在 hit），不是则 -1。起点可能早于 i：
// 包住路径的反引号与 lead 前导词随之删去；其后的节号（“ §三-6”“ 第三节”）也归入单元。
export function missingAt(r: Ref<Rules>, t: Bytes, i: int, out: string, hit: Ref<Hit>): int {
    if (i > 0 && wordByte(at(t, i - 1))) {
        return -1;
    }
    for (pre in r.missing) {
        if (!hasAt(t, i, pre)) {
            continue;
        }
        let j = i + bytesLen(pre);
        while (isPathByte(at(t, j))) {
            j = j + 1;
        }
        while (j > i && (at(t, j - 1) == 46 || at(t, j - 1) == 47)) {
            j = j - 1;
        }
        const path = bytesToStr(slice(t, i, j)) catch "";
        if (len(path) == 0 || !safeRel(path) || kindOf(join(out, path)) != 0) {
            return -1;
        }
        let s = i;
        let e = j;
        if (at(t, s - 1) == 96 && at(t, e) == 96) {
            s = s - 1;
            e = e + 1;
        }
        if (at(t, e) == 32 && hasAt(t, e + 1, r.section)) {
            e = matchAt(r, r.tilde, t, e + 1);
        } else if (at(t, e) == 32 && hasAt(t, e + 1, r.di)) {
            const k = matchAt(r, r.jieTail, t, e + 1);
            if (k > 0) {
                e = k;
            }
        }
        let q = s;
        if (at(t, q - 1) == 32) {
            q = q - 1;
        }
        for (ld in r.leads) {
            const w = bytesLen(ld);
            if (q >= w && hasAt(t, q - w, ld)) {
                s = q - w;
                break;
            }
        }
        hit.pat = pre;
        hit.end = e;
        return s;
    }
    return -1;
}

// 单元之前（隔至多一个空格）的 lead 前导词随单元一起删：得新的起点。
export function leadStart(r: Ref<Rules>, t: Bytes, s: int): int {
    let q = s;
    if (at(t, q - 1) == 32) {
        q = q - 1;
    }
    for (ld in r.leads) {
        const w = bytesLen(ld);
        if (q >= w && hasAt(t, q - w, ld)) {
            return q - w;
        }
    }
    return s;
}

export function findUnit(r: Ref<Rules>, t: Bytes, start: int, out: string, hit: Ref<Hit>): int {
    const n = bytesLen(t);
    let i = start;
    while (i < n) {
        if (at(r.scrubTab, at(t, i)) != 1) {
            i = i + 1;
            continue;
        }
        const s = missingAt(r, t, i, out, hit);
        if (s >= 0) {
            if (s < start) {
                return start;
            }
            return s;
        }
        const e = matchPats(r, r.scrub, t, i, hit);
        if (e > i) {
            const s2 = leadStart(r, t, i);
            if (s2 < start) {
                return start;
            }
            return s2;
        }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    return -1;
}

// 路径是否落在清单项里：项与路径相同，或项以 / 结尾且是路径的前缀（整个目录）。
export function pathCovered(item: string, rel: string): bool {
    return item == rel || (endsWith(item, "/") && startsWith(rel, item));
}

export function keptPath(r: Ref<Rules>, rel: string): bool {
    for (k in r.keep) {
        if (pathCovered(k, rel)) {
            return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
}

// allow 的模式写 * 时放行该处的一切命中。
export function allowedHit(r: Ref<Rules>, rel: string, pat: Bytes): bool {
    for (a in r.allows) {
        if (pathCovered(a.path, rel) && (bytesEqual(a.pat, pat) || (bytesLen(a.pat) == 1 && at(a.pat, 0) == 42))) {
            return true;
        }
    }
    return false;
}
